<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Guidant Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Guidant Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns has started coverage of Guidant Corp with an attractive rating, a source at the firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Guidant's stock opened up 5/8 at 43-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
